Run focused runner tests, result-invariant tests, all pass docs/inventory/scope guards, bounded profiles, all snapshot categories, handwritten-output, examples/output/WAE/runtime, source/package parity, async todo-app sentinel plus Playwright, and exact-head CI/CodeQL.

## ROLLOUT

